  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 00c7e4b39926d0b42b78e88af0359330, type: 3}
  m_Name: 3Spider
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CardData
  CardPages:
  - The Spider Viceroy welcomes the new queen!
  - I heard about how the Conqueror King found you.
  - Later you asked a lot about a certain young man...
  - Even non-humans have ears at court. I can help you.
  - Those gifts of his that you took with you to the castle are the work of a spider.
  - Give me one of the gifts.
  - My subordinates will identify the creator's signature, and he will find out the
    name of the customer.
  Card_name: Viceroy of the Spiders
  LeftChoice:
    text: Give away the horse
    effects: []
    addFlags:
    - 1.3
    - Toy.1
    removeFlags: []
    reactionText:
    - We give such toys to our offspring before their first meal.
    - "That\u2019s how we show which ones can be eaten and which ones can\u2019t."
    - You will find your "patron." I promise!
    rewardItem: {fileID: 0}
    quest: {fileID: 0}
    rewardNote: {fileID: 0}
    rewardAmount: 1
  RightChoice:
    text: Give the box
    effects: []
    addFlags:
    - 1.3
    - Toy.2
    removeFlags: []
    reactionText:
    - We give these boxes to our offspring when they weave their first web.
    - I will certainly find your "patron."
    rewardItem: {fileID: 0}
    quest: {fileID: 0}
    rewardNote: {fileID: 0}
    rewardAmount: 1
